{
  "about": "FR-H7's Template Context Matrix — the ONE copy. Transcribed from appendix-b1-template-contexts.md and proved against tools/probe/record-contexts.py's recordings of T1 and T3 and against Ghost's own source (fixtures/). Read by packages/library/src/contexts.ts, by that recorder and by tools/stress/build.js; no field list is restated anywhere else. A field no recording can show carries `unverified` with its reason.",
