        "custom-{name}.hbs"
      ],
      "offered": [
        "page.hbs",
        "custom-{name}.hbs"
      ],
      "note": "set by Ghost only when the entry is a page; a custom template is assigned to posts too, where it is undefined and prints nothing (§3b). It is offered on custom-{name}.hbs for the page-backed case and the always-present guard hides it on a post."
